<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Application Rejected</title>
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: black;
                background-color: #f8f9fa;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .email-container {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 20px auto;
                background: #fffbee;
                border: 2px solid black;
                border-radius: 8px;
                overflow: hidden;
            }
            .email-header {
                background-color: #d12e2e;
                color: black;
                padding: 20px;
                text-align: center;
                border-bottom: 2px solid black;
            }
            .email-header h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 24px;
            }
            .email-body {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .email-body h2 {
                margin-top: 0;
                color: #b71c1c;
            }
            .email-footer {
                background-color: #f1f1f1;
                padding: 10px;
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 12px;
                border-top: 1px solid black;
                color: #989898;
            }
            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 20px;
                padding: 10px 20px;
                background-color: #efac0f;
                color: black;
                font-weight: bold;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 5px;
                font-size: 16px;
                border: 2px solid black;
                box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px black;
            }
            .button:hover {
                background-color: #b88f3b;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h1>AIcademy Application Update</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="email-body">
                <h2>Dear <%= firstName %>,</h2>
                <p>
                    We regret to inform you that after careful review, your
                    application to join our teaching community has not been
                    approved at this time.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Our review process considers a range of factors, including
                    the provided information and required documentation.
                    Unfortunately, we determined that your application did not
                    meet our criteria.
                </p>
                <p>
                    If you would like to improve your application, you are
                    welcome to update your details and reapply. We encourage you
                    to ensure that all required information is complete and
                    accurate.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Please feel free to reach out to our support team if you
                    have any questions or need further guidance.
                </p>
                <a
                    href="http://localhost:5173/"
                    style="color: black"
                    class="button"
                    >Update Your Application</a
                >
            </div>
            <div class="email-footer">
                <p>
                    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> AIcademy. All rights
                    reserved.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
